{"schema_version":"genshin-world-lore-card-v1","lore_id":"liyue_overview","name_zh":"璃月","name_en":"Liyue","aliases":["璃月","Liyue"],"category":"nation","scope":"regional","regions":["Liyue"],"summary":"璃月是提瓦特七国之一，以岩与契约为核心象征，传统上崇奉岩王帝君。其主城为璃月港，现由璃月七星治理；境内兼有高山、石林、平原、河流等地貌，并包含层岩巨渊与沉玉谷等区域。","canonical_facts":[{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_01","text":"璃月是提瓦特七国之一，也是提瓦特的主要地区之一。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_02","text":"璃月传统上崇奉岩王帝君（Rex Lapis）；岩王帝君是岩神与契约之神。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"长期传统与现状概述","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview","bwiki_liyue_overview"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_03","text":"璃月的代表元素为岩，所奉行的理想为契约。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"国家概述","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview","bwiki_liyue_overview"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_04","text":"璃月的主城是璃月港，现由璃月七星治理。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今","visibility":"regional_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview","bwiki_liyue_overview"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_05","text":"璃月位于提瓦特东部，其景观由高山、石林、开阔平原和河流等地貌共同构成，并随四季呈现不同风貌。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今地理概述","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_06","text":"璃月的重要节庆包括海灯节与逐月节。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现行文化传统","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview","bwiki_liyue_overview"]},{"fact_id":"liyue_overview_fact_07","text":"璃月境内包含层岩巨渊与沉玉谷等区域。","status":"confirmed","temporal_scope":"现今地理划分","visibility":"common_knowledge","source_ids":["fandom_liyue_overview","bwiki_liyue_overview"]}],"timeline":[],"relationships":[],"in_world_visibility":{"public_summary":"璃月作为提瓦特七国之一及岩与契约之国的基本身份、璃月港的地位、璃月七星的治理职责和主要节庆，属于广泛公开的信息。","likely_known_by":["璃月居民","璃月港官署及璃月七星相关人员","往来璃月的商人和旅人","熟悉提瓦特诸国概况者"],"unlikely_known_by":["与璃月及跨国交流长期隔绝者","对璃月地理和政务缺乏接触者"],"common_beliefs_or_misconceptions":["璃月通常被视为崇奉岩王帝君、重视契约的国度。"]},"activation_keys":["璃月","Liyue"],"excluded_material":{"gameplay_only":["进入璃月的任务解锁条件。","仙力、流明石触媒及各类机关的按键、交互、解谜和移动机制。","装置能量、伤害、属性强化、升级、宝箱、掉落及重置规则。","可玩角色与NPC列表、原声带列表及主线章节安排。"],"unsupported_or_speculative":["BWiki所载但未获Fandom主来源支持的详细历史、人物事迹和事件编年。","来源中标为非正式名称的设施或现象名称。","将景观介绍中的修辞性提问解释为具体历史事实。"]},"sources":[{"source_id":"fandom_liyue_overview","provider":"fandom","role":"primary","title":"Liyue","url":"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Liyue","language":"en","revision_id":"2128781","source_text_sha256":"d77596a1e11d617756462b6d3d77143d21ed889be9301b7117f7371aa3863da8"},{"source_id":"bwiki_liyue_overview","provider":"bwiki","role":"cross_language_verification","title":"璃月","url":"https://wiki.biligame.com/ys/%E7%92%83%E6%9C%88","language":"zh-CN","revision_id":"669569","source_text_sha256":"abdbfab01e211495979e3d64dc9cc78d314daa2ca7fa70c2fabfb976af38cfd8"}],"evidence_bundle_sha256":"b3cc8d84b84d8b6ab3c0760568816b2f35ead4fb866c3c317a3d97cddf55ce62","review":{"cross_language_conflicts":[],"uncertain_claims":[],"missing_evidence":["Fandom主来源仅提供国家概览，缺少足以支持详细历史年表的主要来源材料；因此未采用BWiki单独记载的编年内容。"],"needs_human_review":false}}